# NowPlaying: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_NowPlaying.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
setup python3 sandbox/tools/fakeplayer.py &
wait 2
ipc panels open nowPlaying TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
shot np
note find the seek bar (guess y 160, x 1500-1780)
ptr glide 1570 160 200
ptr down
ptr glide 1710 160 400
wait 0.2
shot dragging
note Glass: the knob follows the drag
ptr up
wait 0.8
shot seeked
note the time jumped once to the release point

look glass
setup python3 sandbox/tools/fakeplayer.py &
wait 2
ipc panels open nowPlaying TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
shot np
note find the seek bar (guess y 160, x 1500-1780)
ptr glide 1570 160 200
ptr down
ptr glide 1710 160 400
wait 0.2
shot dragging
note Glass: the knob follows the drag
ptr up
wait 0.8
shot seeked
note the time jumped once to the release point
